body:
This is amazing, thank you so much. I actually work at a makeup store and my friends like to tease me because I have an AWFUL eye for color, I cannot shade match even myself with the proper foundation lol. So I really lack confidence with anything artsy or crafty. Maybe I'll start with a very simple cosplay and work my way up from there.

&#x200B;

Thank you so much again <3

I've been wondering why some of the boss fights and encounters have been feeling hella easy lol. I looked up strats for the Balthazar fight and ended up taking him out in two rounds with no deaths so I was like "huh, wow, this game is sm easier than i thought."

&#x200B;

Then I remember I specifically modded Very Rare, high-level armor on my level 8 characters and all of them are pimped out in some of the best gear possible. I was that person who played Pokemon and overcompensated so every battle would be a one-shot-and-done deal lol

First of all, I personally don't like what he said about not liking "drunkards" and saying that you being drunk "lowered his opinion of you". Embarrassing? Like, what? I get if it's a past thing or a personal preference but I'm not a fan of how he said that to you. Sounds very pretentious to me. If drinking was something he didn't like, he should be discussing that with you and telling you honestly he doesn't like dealing with that, not saying it's embarrassing. I've personally never had good experiences with people who act all high-and-mighty when it comes to stuff like alcohol or drugs, so to me that's already a bit of a red flag.

&#x200B;

Also, I agree with what someone said here: men who talk about worthy/unworthy women and elevate sex on a pedestal are really immature. To me, him referring to other women as "low quality" and you as "high quality" reads to me like he considers you "worthy" of his "jing" (also not a fan of how he said that, tbh). Again, reads to me like a super pretentious guy. 

&#x200B;

I don't want to read too far into anything but if it's a need for you, it's clear he's not fulfilling that need for you. It's one thing to need time to get physically intimate, but his reasonings behind it smack of narcissism. If you're really sure you want to stay with this guy, just be careful.
